{
 "id": "learning_progress_curiosity",
 "version": "1.0.0",
 "self_load_only": true,
 "depends_on": [],
 "area": "retina",
 "description": "LEARNING-PROGRESS-GATED DECAY + THE COMMIT-NET (block 202000). Curiosity/attention gated by learning progress -- the RATE of surprise-reduction on a held item (Schmidhuber compression-progress / Oudeyer IAC) -- NOT by raw surprise. Re-derives on the SAME 196000 staleness_decay atom: learning_progress = residual_prev - residual (the integer backward-difference of the held-surface temporal surprise), and interest is the identical scale2 freshness = Ashr(interest_c0, IDiv(now - last_boost, half_life)) with half_life + clock keyed on PROGRESS instead of surprise. HOLD only the surprising-AND-progressing: resolved decays (progress->0, nothing left), intractable/noisy decays (progress->0, nothing gettable), progressing is held. The raw-surprise FALSIFIER (mode=surprise) keys half_life+clock on the residual itself -> keeps the surprising -> TRAPS on the noisy TV (the classic ICM/prediction-error failure). The COMMIT-NET is an order-0 reflex (cn_commit): the marginal value of deliberation is the SAME diminishing-returns atom value = V_max - Ashr(V_max, step) so marginal = Ashr(V_max, step) halves each step; the net CUTS (committed=1) when marginal < commit_cost -- the regress-breaker (decide-now-or-more cannot itself be deliberated). OFF by default: all rules guard on a HeldCuriosityParams.enabled the measure adapter creates only on opt-in; absent it every path is byte-identical. NO Rust, NO new Term (Abs/Minus/Plus/Times/IDiv/Ashr/Max/Min/IfThenElse/Lt/Gt/Eq/And all exist).",
 "microtheory": {
  "name": "learning_progress_curiosity",
  "description": "Attention gated by learning progress (derivative of surprise-reduction), not raw surprise; the same integer decay atom as perception/memory/emotion, fed a derivative. The commit is an order-0 reflex net that cuts deliberation when its marginal value (the same diminishing-returns atom) drops below cost."
 },
