  {
   "name": "lp_learn",
   "area": "retina",
   "order": 6,
   "latency_class": "hard_realtime",
   "comment": "The predictor learns: integer EMA of the held prediction toward the observation, held += IDiv(obs - held, blend_div). Runs AFTER residual is computed against the OLD held (predictive surprise), so the update only affects the NEXT tick. A structured target converges (residual drops -> positive progress); a noisy target is chased but the residual stays high (progress ~ 0). This is the same convergent held-belief update as staleness_decay's sd_blend, integer-only.",
